Convex 1.44.0. A file containing the text "hello" has been stored. Run inspect once, delete that file successfully, then run inspect again with the same syntactically valid storage ID.

convex/inspect.ts
```ts
import { action } from "./_generated/server";
import { v } from "convex/values";
export const inspect = action({
  args: { storageId: v.id("_storage") },
  handler: async (ctx, args) => {
    const blob = await ctx.storage.get(args.storageId);
    return blob === null ? "missing" : await blob.text();
  },
});
```
